 missing workspaces and authorization failures remain errors. SDK callers can
 inspect [typed deletion outcomes](/sdk/api-errors#deletion-outcomes).
 
+The Docker driver rejects deletion while provisioning is still in progress.
+Retry after provisioning finishes or fails; a rejected deletion does not confirm
+that the sandbox's resources are gone.
+
 ```shell
 openshell sandbox delete my-sandbox
 ```
